        "book": "Jeremiah",
        "chapter": 21,
        "verse": 12
      },
      {
        "text": "Behold, I am against thee, O inhabitant of the valley, and rock of the plain, saith the Lord; which say, Who shall come down against us? or who shall enter into our habitations?",
        "footNotes": [
